							<td width="20%;" height="80px;"> <img class="TEAM_PIC" src="img/Team/Noah.jpg"/></td>
							<td width="2%;" height="80px;"></td>
							<td width="78%;" height="80px;" style="color:white;">
							<p>
								<strong><u>Noah Cham</u></strong> <br>
								Author, scenarist and autodidact illustrator.<br>
								He is one of the founders of the FromScratch (Creative) Studio.<br>
								He is currently working on an online Web-comic project, available very soon: LEGACY.<br>
								His inspiration comes from different influences and univers: Movies, Comic Books, urban cultures, jazz, philisophy and litterature...
							</p>
							</td>
						</tr>
					</table>
				
				</li>
				
                <li style="list-style-type:none">&nbsp;</li>
				
