					<table width="100%;" height="80px"; style="color:white;">
						<tr width="100%;" height="80px;">
							<td width="20%;" height="80px;"> <img class="TEAM_PIC" src="img/Team/MoradA.jpg"/></td>
							<td width="2%;" height="80px;"></td>
							<td width="78%;" height="80px;" style="color:white;">
							<p>
								<strong><u>Morad A.</u></strong> <br>
								Developer and illustrator within the FormScratch Studio.<br>
								He is one of the founder at the origine of the collective.<br>
								Currently, he assists Noah Cham on his Web-comic project, LEGACY, as an illustrator and developer of the web site.<br>
								So he is developer and technical leader on everything concerning web and mobile developments.
							</p>
							</td>
						</tr>
					</table>
				
				</li>
				
                <li style="list-style-type:none">&nbsp;</li>
				
				<li style="list-style-type:none">
					<table width="100%;" height="80px;">
						<tr width="100%;" height="80px;">
							<td width="20%;" height="80px;"> <img class="TEAM_PIC" src="img/Team/3INU.jpg"/></td>
							<td width="2%;" height="80px;"></td>
							<td width="78%;" height="80px;" style="color:white;">
							<p>
								<strong><u>3Inu</u></strong> <br>
								A passionate Beat maker &amp; Sound designer. <br>
								His musical univers is very eclectic, mixing Soul music, Hip-hop influences with a touch of electro music. He loves musical experimentations.<br>
								He already produced several instrumantals in a Hip-hop style for the Studio.<br>
								He is working in his musical project (White Paper) within FromScratch Studio, he also produced some tracks for the Noah Cham's LEGACY projet soundtrack.
							</p>
							</td>
