					<table width="100%;" height="80px;">
						<tr width="100%;" height="80px;">
							<td width="20%;" height="80px;"> <img class="TEAM_PIC" src="img/Team/DanDan.jpg"/></td>
							<td width="2%;" height="80px;"></td>
							<td width="78%;" height="80px;" style="color:white;">
							<p>
								<strong><u>Dany-Dan</u></strong><br>
								Photograph.<br>
								He actively participates to the group's different projects when his photograph skills are needed.<br>
								He's got his own artistic photograph activity but he always follows with a lot of interest the studio's projects and his advises and point of view are very apreciated when it comes to image composition and photography.
							</p>
							</td>
						</tr>
					</table>
				
				</li>
				
                <li style="list-style-type:none">&nbsp;</li>
				
				<li style="list-style-type:none">
					<table width="100%;" height="80px;">
						<tr width="100%;" height="80px;">
							<td width="20%;" height="80px;"> <img class="TEAM_PIC" src="img/Team/Pseudo.jpg"/></td>
							<td width="2%;" height="80px;"></td>
							<td width="78%;" height="80px;" style="color:white;">
							<p>
								<strong><u>Pseudo</u></strong> <br>
								The free electron.<br>
								A real dabbler, he is actually a lyricist, a poet and a graffiti artist!<br>
								He follows and acts in the group as a journalist bringing his shrewd eye, capting inspirations of the moment.<br>
								His help is very precious and apreciated on the graphical projects, he doesn't hesitate to lend his voice and his inspired texts on some musical projects and soundtracks.<br>
							</p>
